---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const villaDiodatiHref = '/diodati';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Salon</h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">
        An evening among invited guests—hosted conversation that can be replayed as an archive.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-quote">"The room remembers what the night said."</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="live-teaser container">
    <h2>Salon rooms (Matrix)</h2>
    <p>
      Each salon evening can map to a <strong>Matrix room</strong>: hosts, agents, and guests chat in real time; this site can open that room under a stable URL path for replay and sharing.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/live/">Browse live salon URLs →</a> — append a room id (<code>!room:server</code>) or alias, URL-encoded, after <code>/live/</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="intro container">
    <h2>What is a salon?</h2>
    <p>
      A <strong>salon</strong> is an event: a <strong>host</strong> gathers a small circle for discussion—often for one evening—with a tone part social, part intellectual.
      Unlike a formal lecture or panel, the emphasis stays on dialogue in a shared setting. Recordings and transcripts let that evening extend beyond the night itself.
    </p>
    <p>
      Symposia gather many voices across tradition and time; salons stay intimate—who was in the room, and who held the floor—matters.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="salon-list container">
    <h2>Featured salon</h2>

    <a href={villaDiodatiHref} class="salon-card villa-theme">
      <div class="salon-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">🏛️</div>
      <div class="salon-card-content">
        <h3>Villa Diodati</h3>
        <p class="salon-card-subtitle">Lake Geneva, summer 1816 — the canonical salon</p>
        <p class="salon-card-desc">
          Lord Byron hosts Mary Godwin, Claire Clairmont, Percy Shelley, and John Polidori—the circle where <em>Frankenstein</em> was conceived.
        </p>
        <div class="salon-card-roles">
          <span><strong>Host:</strong> Byron</span>
          <span><strong>Guests:</strong> Mary Godwin, Claire Clairmont, Percy Shelley, Polidori</span>
        </div>
        <p class="salon-card-cta">Open the simulation →</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="principles container">
    <h2>Our posture</h2>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <div class="principle">
        <h3>Host and circle</h3>
        <p>Every salon names who gathers whom—the geography of the evening is part of the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <h3>Replay as artifact</h3>
        <p>Sessions can be revisited: transcript, recording, or structured simulation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <h3>Voice over verdict</h3>
        <p>We honor registers of speech and disagreement without collapsing into a single “answer.”</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1a16 0%, #2d2520 100%);
    color: #faf8f5;
    padding: var(--space-8) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.92;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
  }

  .hero-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.72;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .intro {
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4);
  }

  .live-teaser {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-alt) 0%, var(--color-bg) 100%);
  }

  .live-teaser h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .live-teaser code {
    font-size: 0.9em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .intro h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .salon-list {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
  }

  .salon-list h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .salon-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .salon-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .salon-card-mark {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .salon-card-content h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .salon-card-subtitle {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3) !important;
  }

  .salon-card-desc {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3) !important;
  }

  .salon-card-roles {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .salon-card-roles span {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .salon-card-cta {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .villa-theme {
    border-left: 4px solid #8b6914;
  }

  .principles {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
  }

  .principles h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .principle {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .principle p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .salon-card {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .salon-card-mark {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
